[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3716309527","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113382#issuecomment-3716309527","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113382","id":3716309527,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dgmIX","user":{"login":"lassebadass","id":33845136,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzODQ1MTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33845136?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lassebadass","html_url":"https://github.com/lassebadass","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lassebadass/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lassebadass/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lassebadass/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lassebadass/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lassebadass/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lassebadass/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lassebadass/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lassebadass/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lassebadass/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-06T20:54:36Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T20:54:36Z","body":"This is also an issue in godot 4.4 and 4.5. Was not an issue in 4.3","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3716309527/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3788503201","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113382#issuecomment-3788503201","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113382","id":3788503201,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hz_ih","user":{"login":"imdongye","id":42573050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTczMDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42573050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye","html_url":"https://github.com/imdongye","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-23T06:18:47Z","updated_at":"2026-01-23T06:19:47Z","body":"Following the logic in 4.3, I tested a custom build by reverting the WM_ACTIVATE handling. I can confirm that this resolves the \"double-tap issue\" where the first touch only triggers a mouse_entered event without a subsequent click.\n\nI am not an expert on Win32 API or Godot’s internal architecture, but it appears the branching logic introduced in 4.4 (intended to reduce SetTimer overhead and improve responsiveness) is the cause. When I modified the code to force-defer all activation events using SetTimer—ignoring the first_activation_done check, as in 4.3—the touch input began working correctly on the first tap.\n\nHowever, an intermittent focus issue remains: touching an inactive window sometimes fails to bring it to the foreground immediately, unless a long-press (right-click) is performed.\n\nI am not submitting a PR because a simple revert might reintroduce legacy code (like first_activation_done) that may not align with the current architecture. I would appreciate it if a Windows platform maintainer could review this branching logic.\n\nCurrent problematic code: [L4839](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c3058391d7bd1a13481c393061c164c24ec99685/platform/windows/display_server_windows.cpp#L4839)\n\nPrevious working code (4.3): [L4026](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c6c91cfcadb64e701a407e4eae903529ff96dcfd/platform/windows/display_server_windows.cpp#L4026)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3788503201/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3935148007","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113382#issuecomment-3935148007","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113382","id":3935148007,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qjZfn","user":{"login":"FluffyBunnyO","id":96749090,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcRGIg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96749090?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FluffyBunnyO","html_url":"https://github.com/FluffyBunnyO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FluffyBunnyO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FluffyBunnyO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FluffyBunnyO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FluffyBunnyO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FluffyBunnyO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FluffyBunnyO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FluffyBunnyO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FluffyBunnyO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FluffyBunnyO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-20T14:21:41Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T14:46:32Z","body":"version 4.6.1 issue sustains\nI've managed to mitigate it by adding a TouchScreenButton. \nHowever, this is not a good solution since it was not meant for it and it is not a control which is essential for a button to be.\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3935148007/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4702129562","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113382#issuecomment-4702129562","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113382","id":4702129562,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGETNmg","user":{"login":"imdongye","id":42573050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTczMDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42573050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye","html_url":"https://github.com/imdongye","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/imdongye/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-14T15:04:44Z","updated_at":"2026-06-14T15:04:44Z","body":"I confirmed that both issues (double-tap and focus) have disappeared in 4.7 RC2.\n\nI haven't figured out the exact reason why it was fixed. Seeing that the codes for handling touch messages, including the part here: [L4839 ](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c3058391d7bd1a13481c393061c164c24ec99685/platform/windows/display_server_windows.cpp#L4839) , haven't changed, it seems likely that modifications to the input event processing side resolved the issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4702129562/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]